{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19665","headline":"赠友人 · 吕温","name":"赠友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山双乔松，擢本皆千寻。\n夕流膏露津，朝被青云阴。\n负雪出深涧，摇风倚高岑。\n明堂久不构，云干何森森。\n匠意方雕巧，时情正夸淫。\n生材会有用，天地岂无心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}